1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,060
Man: Are you going to the community cleanup event on Saturday?

2
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:16,120
Woman: Yes. I think it's a great way to help out and meet new people.

3
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:23,100
Man: I agree. It starts at 9 a. m. Do you know where we're supposed to meet?

4
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:27,040
Woman: Yes, we're meeting at the park entrance

5
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:31,150
Don't forget to bring gloves and trash bags.

6
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:34,220
Man: Thanks. I'll see you there.
